# Queue row 161. d_replace_registered_undefended trips the order-blind
# deepStrictEqual first, so the key-ORDER assertion added alongside it was
# itself unmutated. This refusal keeps every entry - so the order-blind check
# still passes - and only rebuilds the registry in sorted order. The registry's
